pas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"7dLQkwWU2fRqTlvplg0iMw","review_id":"hahM75-uwOlewEg12DHijQ","date":"2016-09-23T18:16:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9402430653572083,"text_excerpt":"Y'all. This place is awesome. It's space is very airy and welcoming. It's modern but still has a bit of a rustic vibe. The baristas are SUPER friendly which I feel like is rare in urban cities like NOLA. I've been in many a coffee shop where the baristas are snobby hipsters, but that's not the case here. Alex and Jess were behind the counter and they were incredibly friendly and helpful. I had their cold brew which is nice and dark. I haven't tried their other drinks, but I'll definitely be back. Free WIFI btw, which is always a plus!"},{"business_id":"7dLQkwWU2fRqTlvplg0iMw","review_id":"B3zlkpY22BMOFKvelzfD4g","date":"2019-06-07T16:49:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9284985065460205,"text_excerpt":"This is a great coffee shop located in the Central Business District. The barista was friendly and extremely quick in preparing our drinks. I would highly, highly recommend getting an espresso shot (or two) here, as they pull some of the best shots in New Orleans. The shots are dialed-in, smooth, and balaced; they also have tea, chai, and kombucha. The music/environment is a bit loud (not obtrussive or anything, just not a \"quiet place\"), so this would be a great spot to stop at if you were trying to get some work done. It may be a bit distracting if trying to study, but I didn't have any problem with it. There was plently of inside seating and multiple outlets at every table. Overall, I ..."},{"business_id":"7dLQkwWU2fRqTlvplg0iMw","review_id":"66iCN2iUZPg5p1g9jBSfbQ","date":"2016-09-17T13:45:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9268086552619934,"text_excerpt":"This place is great!! Clean, hipster vibe, minimalist menu, very friendly staff & really really great coffee. I got the espresso & almond milk with vanilla syrup & it was just a really good drink! I strongly recommend this place."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7dLQkwWU2fRqTlvplg0iMw","photo_id":"DUqIUNvyZAv4yP74kaGB_A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DUqIUNvyZAv4yP74kaGB_A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8858053684234619},{"business_id":"7dLQkwWU2fRqTlvplg0iMw","photo_id":"m_8Ea5NA1RXkdbVE6auh0g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/m_8Ea5NA1RXkdbVE6auh0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8739856481552124},{"business_id":"7dLQkwWU2fRqTlvplg0iMw","photo_id":"5lER5lOWWNdLWfEeDgSfQA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/5lER5lOWWNdLWfEeDgSfQA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8671948313713074},{"business_id":"7dLQkwWU2fRqTlvplg0iMw","photo_id":"ITtYhI-WgMwPcXEZpiX_xA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/ITtYhI-WgMwPcXEZpiX_xA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8578616976737976},{"business_id":"7dLQkwWU2fRqTlvplg0iMw","photo_id":"6gsQqR2VtuQ5nHdgCBD8NQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6gsQqR2VtuQ5nHdgCBD8NQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8186452388763428}]},"notebook_case":null}
